{
  "title": "koylu_muhabbet_thessra",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node:start",
      "type": "START",
      "position": "(0.0, 0.0)"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:selam",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(350.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Thessra",
      "text": "Greetings, gatekeeper. Stone gives voice, hammer measures weight. I measure fractures along the rampart curtain; is there news from the trail?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_normal",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, -180.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "Master Thessra, are the village ramparts and water conduits sound?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_kriz",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "Can these walls withstand the blow of a catapult or battering ram?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_karar",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, 180.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "What is your judgment regarding the newcomers admitted through the gate?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_normal",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, -180.0)",
      "character": "Thessra",
      "text": "The timber palisades of the northern wall were beginning to rot; I raised a stone plinth bonded with hydraulic lime. The andesite ashlar blocks we hauled from the quarry will stand firm for two hundred years."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_kriz",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Thessra",
      "text": "I sloped the outer revetment; stones hurled against it will glance harmlessly away. Yet we must brace the gate leaf with oak shores behind. I requested double-riveted forged iron hinges from Karaca Usta."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_karar",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, 180.0)",
      "character": "Thessra",
      "text": "That laborer knows how to mix mortar exceedingly well, gatekeeper! I looked at the lime burns on his palms; they are the hands of a master mason. We are raising the ditch revetment together, and our work has doubled in speed."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_normal",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1400.0, -180.0)",
      "description": "Köy Morali",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_kriz",
